Upstream: https://github.com/macosforge/alac
Commit:   c38887c5c5e64a4b31108733bd79ca9b2496d987
Licence:  Apache-2.0 (LICENSE)

Files taken from codec/ at that commit:
  ALACDecoder.cpp, ALACDecoder.h, ALACAudioTypes.h,
  ALACBitUtilities.c, ALACBitUtilities.h, ag_dec.c, aglib.h,
  dp_dec.c, dplib.h, matrix_dec.c, matrixlib.h,
